{
  "title": "EC2 Auto Scaling · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "정책에 따라 인스턴스 수를 조절하고 비정상 인스턴스를 교체한다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span> Auto Scaling</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#launch-template\">Launch Template</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#minimum-desired-and-maximum-capacity\">Minimum, Desired and Maximum Capacity</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#health-checks-and-replacement\">Health Checks and Replacement</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#target-tracking-scaling\">Target Tracking Scaling</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#step-and-simple-scaling\">Step and Simple Scaling</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#scheduled-and-predictive-scaling\">Scheduled and Predictive Scaling</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#mixed-instances-and-spot\">Mixed Instances and Spot</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#lifecycle-hooks-and-instance-refresh\">Lifecycle Hooks and Instance Refresh</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>컴퓨팅</span><span>16 / 62</span></div><h1>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span> Auto Scaling</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 8 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span> Auto Scaling은 정한 용량 범위를 유지하고 부하에 따라 Instance 수를 조절한다. Auto Scaling Group은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#launch-template\">Launch Template</a>, Subnet·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>, Desired·Minimum·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#minimum-desired-and-maximum-capacity\">Maximum Capacity</a> 등을 묶는다.</p><p>Load Balancer는 요청을 분산하고 ASG는 Instance를 생성·교체·종료한다. 두 기능을 함께 사용하면 부하 변화와 Instance 장애에 대응할 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Scale-out과 상태 복구\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Scale-out과 상태 복구</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Demand change</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\">CloudWatch</a> metric</strong><small>목표 CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span>·요청량</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Scaling policy</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#minimum-desired-and-maximum-capacity\">Desired Capacity</a> 조정</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>New instances</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#launch-template\">Launch Template</a>으로 시작</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Instance failure</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Health Check</strong><small>비정상 Instance 탐지</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Auto Scaling Group</strong><small>원하는 수 유지</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Replacement</strong><small>Healthy Target으로 진입</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\"><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>는 요청을 분산하고 ASG는 Instance 수·교체를 관리한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"launch-template\"><h2>Launch Template<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#launch-template\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a>·Instance Type·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>·User Data 등의 시작 설정을 제공한다. 변경은 버전으로 관리하고 새 Instance가 어떤 버전을 쓰는지 확인한다. 기존 Instance를 새 버전으로 바꾸려면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#lifecycle-hooks-and-instance-refresh\">Instance Refresh</a> 등 별도 절차가 필요하다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"minimum-desired-and-maximum-capacity\"><h2>Minimum, Desired and Maximum Capacity<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#minimum-desired-and-maximum-capacity\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Minimum은 유지할 최소 수, Desired는 현재 목표, Maximum은 확장의 상한이다. Policy가 Desired를 바꿔도 Maximum을 넘지 않는다. Instance 수 대신 Weighted Capacity를 사용하는 구성도 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"health-checks-and-replacement\"><h2>Health Checks and Replacement<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#health-checks-and-replacement\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> Health Check와 구성한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB</a> Health Check 등을 사용해 비정상 Instance를 교체한다. Grace Period와 앱 준비 시간을 맞춘다. ASG가 앱의 모든 논리 오류를 자동으로 이해하는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"target-tracking-scaling\"><h2>Target Tracking Scaling<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#target-tracking-scaling\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span>나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a> Request Count 등 Metric을 목표 값 근처로 유지한다. 앱 부하와 처리 용량에 비례하는 Metric을 고르는 것이 중요하다. 단순 총 요청 수처럼 Instance 수와 관계없는 지표는 적합하지 않을 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"step-and-simple-scaling\"><h2>Step and Simple Scaling<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#step-and-simple-scaling\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\">CloudWatch</a> Alarm에 따라 단계별 용량 변경을 정의한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#step-and-simple-scaling\">Step Scaling</a>은 Alarm의 초과 정도에 따라 변경 폭을 다르게 한다. Cooldown·Warmup을 조절하지 않으면 준비 중인 용량 때문에 과도한 확장이 발생할 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"scheduled-and-predictive-scaling\"><h2>Scheduled and Predictive Scaling<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#scheduled-and-predictive-scaling\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#scheduled-and-predictive-scaling\">Scheduled Scaling</a>은 알려진 시간에 용량을 조절한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#scheduled-and-predictive-scaling\">Predictive Scaling</a>은 과거 부하 패턴으로 필요한 용량을 예측한다. 갑작스러운 예상 외 변화에는 Reactive Policy도 함께 고려한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"mixed-instances-and-spot\"><h2>Mixed Instances and Spot<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#mixed-instances-and-spot\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>여러 Instance Type과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-instances\">On-Demand</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-instances\">Spot</a>을 조합할 수 있다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-instances\">Spot</a> 분산과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-interruption-and-rebalance\">Capacity Rebalancing</a>으로 중단 영향을 줄인다. 단일 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-instances\">Spot</a> Pool에 의존하면 같은 유형·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 Capacity 회수에 취약하다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"lifecycle-hooks-and-instance-refresh\"><h2>Lifecycle Hooks and Instance Refresh<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#lifecycle-hooks-and-instance-refresh\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Hook으로 시작·종료 단계에서 초기화나 작업 마무리를 수행한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#lifecycle-hooks-and-instance-refresh\">Instance Refresh</a>는 정한 건강 용량 비율을 지키며 새 설정으로 교체한다. ASG 안의 Local Disk만 보존할 데이터 저장소로 쓰지 않는다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>낮에는 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 요청이 늘고 밤에는 줄면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>와 Target Tracking을 사용한다. 종료 Hook은 처리 중 작업을 마무리하되 영구 데이터는 외부 저장소에 둔다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>ASG 자체는 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 요청을 분산하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">로드 밸런서</a>가 그 역할을 맡는다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/autoscaling/ec2/userguide/what-is-amazon-ec2-auto-scaling.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">autoscaling/ec2/userguide/what-is-amazon-ec2-auto-scaling.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q031/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q031\" data-question=\"Q031\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q031</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q031/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to add EC2 instances as web traffic changes and replace unhealthy instances. Which feature should it configure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q031\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q031\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q031\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q031\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS snapshots only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">ASG</a>가 원하는 용량과 확장 정책, 상태 확인을 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">EC2 Auto Scaling</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q084\" data-question=\"Q084\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1,2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q084</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q084/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO components allow a stateless web tier to scale with demand and withstand an Availability Zone failure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q084\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EC2 instance with an Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q084\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer with targets in multiple AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q084\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling configured for multiple AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q084\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS volume shared from one AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q084\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudTrail queries only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B, C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">ASG</a>가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 용량을 유지·확장하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>가 건강한 대상으로 요청을 분산한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">EC2 Auto Scaling</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q098\" data-question=\"Q098\" data-revision=\"2\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q098</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q098/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company has a Compute Savings Plan but must also ensure that matching EC2 capacity is available in one specific Availability Zone for a launch. Which additional option should it configure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q098\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A regional Reserved Instance only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q098\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An On-Demand Capacity Reservation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q098\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 reservation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q098\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Spot Fleet with no On-Demand capacity</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a>는 사용 비용 할인이며 Capacity를 예약하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">On-Demand Capacity Reservation</a>은 지정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>·구성의 실행 용량을 확보한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Regional RI</a>도 Capacity를 예약하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q002\" data-question=\"Q002\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q002</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q002/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A web tier must withstand a data center failure within one Region. Which deployment is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Two ENIs on the same EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Two instances using one EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Two instances in a single Availability Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Instances deployed across different Availability Zones</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>는 독립적인 장애 영역이다. 서로 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>에 웹 인스턴스를 둔다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q032\" data-question=\"Q032\" data-revision=\"2\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q032</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q032/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company must use existing per-socket software licenses on EC2 and needs visibility into physical sockets and cores, plus control over instance placement on a specific host. Which option should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Hosts</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compute Savings Plans</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Spot Instances</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a>는 Physical Host의 Socket·Core 가시성과 Instance Placement·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Host Affinity</a>를 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a>는 전용 Hardware 격리를 제공하지만 같은 Host 제어·가시성을 제공하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">이전 용어 <b>EC2</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">다음 용어 <b>EC2 Purchasing Options</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
